"DXMT is off: the engine’s standard Direct3D is back (it often freezes on the Mac with Direct3D 11)." = "DXMT desligado: volta o Direct3D padrão do motor (que costuma travar no Mac com Direct3D 11).";
"Windows programs’ menus will appear in the Mac menu bar. Reopen the programs to apply.\n\nTo turn this off for just one program, Control-click it in the Library." = "Os menus dos programas Windows vão aparecer na barra de menus do Mac. Reabra os programas para aplicar.\n\nPara desligar só um programa: botão direito nele na Biblioteca.";
