"macOS packaging of Wine and Wine Staging that WinApps’ engine is built from." = "Empacotamento do Wine e do Wine Staging para macOS a partir do qual o motor do WinApps é compilado.";
"Direct3D 10/11 to Metal translation. WinApps’ modifications are in patches/dxmt/ and are built by engine/build-dxmt.sh." = "Tradução de Direct3D 10/11 para Metal. As modificações do WinApps estão em patches/dxmt/ e são compiladas por engine/build-dxmt.sh.";
